00:11:20.798 --> 00:11:21.691
and started living it.

00:11:21.691 --> 00:11:24.884
So far, I think my relationship
with Niki has improved

00:11:24.884 --> 00:11:28.332
a little bit but we'll see
if she thinks that tomorrow

00:11:28.332 --> 00:11:30.351
when hopefully she's feeling better

00:11:30.351 --> 00:11:31.914
cause she really was
looking forward to this.

00:11:31.914 --> 00:11:34.724
So hopefully that didn't drag
her experience down too much.

00:11:34.724 --> 00:11:37.474
Cause she improved my experience.

00:11:39.583 --> 00:11:42.250
(dripping rain)

00:11:44.031 --> 00:11:45.760
How are you feeling Niki?

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:47.271
- Better
- That's good.

00:11:47.271 --> 00:11:49.122
- Sorry for throwing up in front of you.

00:11:49.122 --> 00:11:51.794
- I don't care.
We slept so late today.

00:11:51.794 --> 00:11:53.284
- I know.
- We slept like 10 hours.

00:11:53.284 --> 00:11:55.794
- It's so dark up there.
- It's so dark.

00:11:55.794 --> 00:11:58.223
- But I like waking up in the trees.

00:11:58.223 --> 00:11:59.484
Alright, we did it, we
lived in a tree house.

00:11:59.484 --> 00:12:03.261
I had a lot of fun despite
throwing up several times

00:12:03.261 --> 00:12:04.183
last night.

00:12:04.183 --> 00:12:05.343
- When you sign-up to live in a tree house

00:12:05.343 --> 00:12:07.183
the number one thing on your
list is not practicalities.

00:12:07.183 --> 00:12:09.084
Is it fun for a couple of days?

00:12:09.084 --> 00:12:13.033
Yes, it's a lot of fun.
- This living situation,

00:12:13.033 --> 00:12:14.903
by default did bring us closer together

00:12:14.903 --> 00:12:17.175
because we like shared
a tiny loft together.

00:12:17.175 --> 00:12:19.793
He totally like released
his inner child yesterday

00:12:19.793 --> 00:12:22.604
of like running around the
property, doing the zip line,

00:12:22.604 --> 00:12:25.154
getting on the pendulum swing,
so it was fun to see him

00:12:25.154 --> 00:12:28.175
like kind of drop all
sense of practicalities

00:12:28.175 --> 00:12:30.204
and just kind of enjoy it.

00:12:30.204 --> 00:12:33.454
- Good-bye tree house.
- Bye tree house.

00:12:34.462 --> 00:12:37.543
- [Announcer] Next week on Home Buddies

00:12:37.543 --> 00:12:39.763
- RV
- Recreational Vehicle

00:12:39.763 --> 00:12:41.754
This is probably the most
different living style we've done.

00:12:41.754 --> 00:12:44.735
- I'm just really worried about
a poop situation happening.

00:12:44.735 --> 00:12:46.244
- Here I am at the Grand Caymans.

00:12:46.244 --> 00:12:47.463
- There are too many obstacles.

00:12:47.463 --> 00:12:48.703
- Yeah, it always is great for you.

00:12:48.703 --> 00:12:50.084
- He wants to be in control.
- I'm trying

00:12:50.084 --> 00:12:51.804
not to become defensive.
(Grunting)

00:12:51.804 --> 00:12:53.852
- I think we're gonna be
at each other's throats.

00:12:53.852 --> 00:12:56.435
(upbeat music)

